aracter Creator Right Size.png", "id": "1103106865474694", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593749142_1103106868808027_34546925129624968_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qXnaFZywcbQQ7kNvwEDUdfG&_nc_oc=Adq881gd4hxJRLJFohAYD-KyDJ3xUCbmFp0WSEz7KbMt5m8Uqjks5-AVAtFxt-qo5vI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRiSVMQsb-BgsIkpnmvhOY0CNMm4cMqrmxHYBk4Pz_mHQ&oe=6B01EC22"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Roundnet VR", "keywords": ["Spikeball", "Handball", "Sports"], "long_description": "Roundnet VR Is Here! Play opponents in online multiplayer, or customizable bots to match your skill level. \n\nDon't know how to play Roundnet, that's all good. The game runs you through an interactive practice match that teaches the rules and some basic strategy. \n\nRoundnet VR is being made by one VR dev who loves Spikeball\u2122, and is still a work in progress. There are many features and polish that I want to add. Judge it with that in mind and please give me feedback!\n\n\ud83d\udc49 Join the Discord to get the latest news and meet other Roundnet enjoyers: https://discord.gg/fcndeRACZ\n\nPlay In **Mixed Reality**\n{2402806200459235}\n\nCreate your own **Custom Characters**\n{1712954353118039}", "short_description": "Roundnet VR is a recreation of the popular game Spikeball in VR. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://glassfrogstudios.com/PrivacyPolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "GanBro Systems Inc", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/fcndeRACZ", "website_url": "https://glassfrogstudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null